  "_readme": "EMC x TSC1/TSC2 frequency probe, ROUND 2, 2026-08-24. Round 1 (emc-tsc-mtor-targets.json) established that Europe PMC returns 41 records co-mentioning EMC and TSC1/TSC2, none of which was shown to REPORT TSC status in EMC, and that PRECISION 1 (NCT05103358) is ACTIVE_NOT_RECRUITING. Round 2 goes after the DENOMINATOR two ways. (a) cBioPortal: EMC is a codable OncoTree type (EMCHS), and sarcoma_msk_2022 holds 7,494 soft-tissue and bone sarcoma samples, so the count of EMCHS samples and their TSC1/TSC2 status is a DIRECT measurement rather than a literature inference. Several endpoint shapes are tried per question because the API version served is not known from here; the manifest records which returned 200, and a 404 row is evidence about the API, not about EMC. (b) the pan-sarcoma comprehensive-genomic-profiling full texts, to see whether any breaks EMC out as its own histology and reports TSC1/TSC2 for it. PMC11874058 (the AACR GENIE 1407-ultra-rare-sarcoma paper) is NOT open access, which is why its fullTextXML 404'd in round 1; PMC9890057 analyses histology-agnostic targets in the same database and IS open access.",
